## Permitted Purpose

Any purpose, but for evaluation purposes only.

## Trial Period

Your initial trial period starts the first time you use any version of the
software, and lasts 32 days. If you use a new version of the software while
your initial trial period is still ongoing, the new version becomes part of
your initial trial. New trial periods become available for new commercial
applications of the software.

## Defensive Termination

If you make any written claim that the software infringes or contributes to
infringement of any patent, your patent license for the software granted
under these terms ends immediately. If your company makes such a claim, your
patent license ends immediately for work on behalf of your company.

## No Other Rights

These terms do not allow you to sublicense or transfer any of your licenses
